WEBVTT

00:47.400 --> 00:53.150
A ray of light, a glimpse of hope

00:54.040 --> 00:59.590
Rising through thorns, a
glimmer through the cracks

01:00.780 --> 01:06.540
Look up and behold, transcending time

01:07.410 --> 01:13.020
Through ages and cataclysms,
I'll stand watch for you

01:13.730 --> 01:19.390
Even millennia later, I won't forget you

01:20.260 --> 01:25.770
In a world without
you, I'll defy fate itself

01:25.780 --> 01:31.030
Cracks, piercing through the heart

01:31.500 --> 01:38.050
Armoured, at the end of a vast battlefield

01:38.400 --> 01:44.410
Light slipping through my fingers

01:44.990 --> 01:51.500
My fate, under my command
who cares if it's divine or demonic?

01:51.520 --> 01:57.920
Cracks, piercing through the heart

01:58.280 --> 02:02.399
Eternity unbroken,
love and hate left behind

02:02.400 --> 02:07.520
All passed by

02:09.130 --> 02:14.410
Cracks, piercing through the heart

02:15.030 --> 02:21.850
Armoured, at the end of a vast battlefield

02:21.860 --> 02:28.210
Light slipping through my fingers

02:28.220 --> 02:35.000
When the end arrives,
no one will destroy me

02:35.150 --> 02:38.360
Forever unyielding

02:41.750 --> 02:47.460
Forever undying

02:47.960 --> 02:50.160
World of Immortals

02:50.161 --> 02:51.220
 Dragon Island Arc

02:51.740 --> 02:54.220
Episode 2

02:54.221 --> 02:56.700
Celestial Maiden Returns

02:57.220 --> 02:59.239
Previously

02:59.240 --> 03:01.039
I came to witness the goddess's ascension,

03:01.040 --> 03:02.040
not to fight.

03:03.140 --> 03:04.449
If you do not perish today,

03:04.450 --> 03:06.370
the royal family's
reputation will be tarnished.

03:08.650 --> 03:10.460
<i>Divine guidance gathers spiritual energy,</i>

03:11.200 --> 03:13.880
<i>and only through achieving nirvana
can one attain true immortality.</i>

03:15.710 --> 03:18.070
I never expected that the
legendary sacred beast of Jiuzhou

03:18.110 --> 03:20.320
truly exists in the World of Immortals.

03:20.890 --> 03:22.850
I am Wang Zifeng from the Undying Sect.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.880
I am Liu Yue from the Undying Sect.

03:25.680 --> 03:26.960
I apologise for the disturbance.

03:39.010 --> 03:41.790
You mentioned that you
come from the mortal realm.

03:42.420 --> 03:43.420
Indeed.

03:43.790 --> 03:45.600
I am Wang Zifeng of the Undying Sect.

03:45.880 --> 03:47.380
Our founder, the Undying Evil King,

03:47.390 --> 03:50.230
is also a Nirvana Realm expert
who ascended from the mortal realm.

03:51.720 --> 03:54.280
<i>It seems they have mistaken me
for an expert who has ascended.</i>

03:56.120 --> 03:58.780
What exactly is this "Nirvana
Realm" you mentioned?

04:02.560 --> 04:04.600
In the World of Immortals,
various clans exist,

04:04.720 --> 04:05.860
each with distinct methods,

04:06.300 --> 04:08.500
but strength is generally
categorised into five realms.

04:09.740 --> 04:12.660
Mortal

04:10.180 --> 04:12.280
The first is the "Mortal Shedding,"

04:12.661 --> 04:15.580
Shedding

04:12.760 --> 04:15.360
where practitioners connect
with elemental forces,

04:15.380 --> 04:16.660
channelling them into techniques

04:16.920 --> 04:19.139
based on their cultivated arts.

04:19.140 --> 04:21.340
Insight

04:20.400 --> 04:22.240
The second, "Insight Treasury,"

04:21.341 --> 04:23.540
Treasury

04:23.040 --> 04:26.080
allows one to unlock
inner spiritual treasures

04:26.220 --> 04:27.820
and gain various supernatural abilities.

04:28.640 --> 04:29.960
Above these

04:30.040 --> 04:33.400
are 'Skywalking',
'Nirvana', and 'Immortality'.

04:33.800 --> 04:36.240
Each with nine levels.

04:36.480 --> 04:39.160
Mastery across all nine in a realm
permits advancement to the next.

04:39.680 --> 04:42.680
For formidable figures like yourself,

04:44.240 --> 04:48.320
only by reaching the Nirvana Realm
can one break through to ascend.

04:49.200 --> 04:52.246
With just a bit more attainment to the
pure essence of spiritual energy here,

04:52.270 --> 04:54.240
you could step into
the path of Immortality.

04:56.360 --> 04:58.560
I've always admired
those with such strength.

04:59.440 --> 05:03.800
May I ask which level within the
Nirvana Realm you have reached?

05:08.680 --> 05:10.080
<i>She's testing my strength.</i>

05:19.500 --> 05:20.500
The fire is dying down.

05:20.540 --> 05:21.960
I'll go gather some branches.

05:23.500 --> 05:25.220
<i>These two do not come with good intentions.</i>

05:25.280 --> 05:26.820
<i>What could they be after?</i>

05:27.930 --> 05:29.730
I have just arrived in
the World of Immortals

05:30.280 --> 05:32.800
and am unaware if this
island has any unique features.

05:33.680 --> 05:36.040
This place is known as Dragon Island,

05:37.160 --> 05:40.759
a training ground for the young
masters of various major forces

05:40.760 --> 05:43.080
in the World of Immortals who
come here to seek treasures.

05:43.620 --> 05:46.260
This person's strength has yet to
reach the Mortal Shedding realm.

05:46.890 --> 05:47.890
Prepare to take action.

05:50.080 --> 05:52.160
Although the island is
teeming with savage beasts,

05:52.470 --> 05:53.920
it is rich in resources,

05:54.640 --> 05:57.160
with countless spiritual herbs
and crystals available, and

05:57.770 --> 05:59.540
even dragon eggs can be found here.

05:59.541 --> 06:00.550
<i>Sacred dragon eggs?</i>

06:09.920 --> 06:11.239
<i>I am injured.</i>

06:11.240 --> 06:12.520
<i>I cannot confront them directly.</i>

06:21.520 --> 06:23.880
You are referring to this
dragon egg, aren't you?

06:26.990 --> 06:28.760
I found one in a seaside cave.

06:28.910 --> 06:30.550
I didn't expect it to be such a treasure.

06:31.230 --> 06:34.910
Are you saying there are
more dragon eggs in the cave?

06:35.410 --> 06:36.410
That's right.

06:36.590 --> 06:37.870
If you're interested,

06:37.880 --> 06:38.960
I can lead you there.

06:47.820 --> 06:48.919
The flying fish are swarming.

06:48.920 --> 06:51.120
The eight-armed evil
dragon should be nearby.

06:51.121 --> 06:52.919
Evil Dragon Beach

06:52.920 --> 06:55.160
This brat hasn't even reached
the Mortal Shedding realm,

06:55.480 --> 06:57.320
yet he dares to impersonate an ascendant.

06:57.800 --> 07:00.330
Once we get the dragon
egg, we'll take him out.

07:03.180 --> 07:08.240
Evil Dragon Beach • Lair

07:17.040 --> 07:18.040
We have arrived.

07:36.250 --> 07:37.250
Yue,

07:37.460 --> 07:39.190
Xiao helped us find the dragon egg.

07:39.440 --> 07:41.000
Why aren't you thanking him?

07:42.680 --> 07:43.760
Your gratitude is too much.

07:44.110 --> 07:45.380
It was just a chance discovery.

07:46.640 --> 07:48.140
Xiao Chen,

07:48.630 --> 07:52.600
you must not refuse our kindness.

07:57.720 --> 07:59.549
I have already helped
you obtain the dragon egg.

07:59.550 --> 08:00.720
What do you mean by this?

08:02.920 --> 08:05.160
The dragon egg is a rare treasure.

08:05.520 --> 08:09.320
No one should know
that we have obtained it.

08:18.560 --> 08:20.130
Yue, act quickly!

08:33.740 --> 08:35.280
<i>The fish leap into the air.</i>

08:35.560 --> 08:37.360
<i>The eight-armed evil
dragon should be nearby.</i>

08:38.120 --> 08:39.130
<i>The water pool trembles,</i>

08:39.320 --> 08:40.880
<i>likely due to the dragon surfacing.</i>

08:41.880 --> 08:43.960
<i>I need to seal my senses
the moment the dragon roars</i>

08:44.650 --> 08:46.830
<i>as the impact will last
for about three breaths.</i>

08:47.110 --> 08:48.320
<i>I must succeed in this battle.</i>

08:57.310 --> 08:58.310
No!

09:10.760 --> 09:11.760
Yue!

09:28.370 --> 09:30.820
Unfortunately, I only managed to kill one.

09:32.280 --> 09:35.760
You little brat actually
dared to scheme against us.

09:35.920 --> 09:38.340
Wasn't it you who schemed first?

09:42.120 --> 09:43.630
I will kill you.

10:32.480 --> 10:35.480
You dare to conspire against
the disciples of the Undying Sect.

10:37.280 --> 10:41.120
I will ensure your complete annihilation.

10:44.590 --> 10:46.030
Undying Demonic Art!

10:56.160 --> 10:57.200
What is this technique?

11:10.160 --> 11:11.760
You insolent brat,

11:12.160 --> 11:14.000
you will pay for my junior's life.

11:14.360 --> 11:15.360
This power...

11:15.960 --> 11:16.960
Something is off.

11:18.290 --> 11:19.820
Let's die together.

11:19.821 --> 11:25.380
Blood-fall Seal

11:19.920 --> 11:21.320
Blood-fall Seal!

12:05.720 --> 12:07.316
<i>The evil dragon is returning to its lair.</i>

12:07.340 --> 12:08.700
<i>I must leave here quickly.</i>

12:15.820 --> 12:20.780
Nearshore Forest • Stream

12:21.900 --> 12:24.181
<i>The techniques of the Undying
Sect are indeed formidable.</i>

12:24.300 --> 12:25.640
<i>Without that cultivation method,</i>

12:25.810 --> 12:28.450
<i>relying solely on physical strength
would not withstand that blow.</i>

12:41.800 --> 12:43.160
You are here as well?

12:47.200 --> 12:48.200
Zhao Lin'er?

12:50.600 --> 12:52.840
To meet an old friend from
Jiuzhou on this wild island

12:53.020 --> 12:54.370
is truly a stroke of luck.

12:55.290 --> 12:58.720
Are you trying to invoke my sympathy
with sentiments from our homeland?

12:59.360 --> 13:00.480
Do not forget

13:00.600 --> 13:02.600
that I ended up in this
place because of you.

13:04.320 --> 13:05.410
This place is perilous.

13:06.140 --> 13:07.660
Why not set aside our grievances

13:07.840 --> 13:09.800
and work together to find
a way back to Jiuzhou?

13:10.040 --> 13:11.440
Set aside our grievances?

13:11.630 --> 13:13.120
What a foolish dream.

13:33.580 --> 13:38.540
Land of Deathly Silence

13:56.340 --> 13:58.420
There is no need to resort
to such extreme measures.

14:06.840 --> 14:08.840
I am in this plight because of you.

14:10.160 --> 14:12.600
I will make sure you
suffer a terrible fate.

14:17.000 --> 14:18.000
<i>Ancient Tyrannosaurus Rex</i>

14:20.720 --> 14:21.720
Perhaps

14:22.170 --> 14:24.800
you deserve a more tragic death.

14:27.680 --> 14:28.680
Why did she leave?

14:37.080 --> 14:38.080
Is this

14:38.740 --> 14:39.940
the Ancient Tyrannosaurus Rex?

14:39.941 --> 14:42.420
Primitive Tyrannosaurus Rex

15:02.520 --> 15:04.480
Dying beneath the fangs of a giant dragon,

15:05.210 --> 15:07.690
you would indeed be considered
the foremost person in Jiuzhou.

15:13.050 --> 15:14.050
It has finally left.

15:14.310 --> 15:15.200
That was a close call.

15:15.290 --> 15:16.640
I almost got caught.

15:28.720 --> 15:29.720
Wait.

15:29.720 --> 15:30.720
Don't move.

16:57.290 --> 16:58.540
<i>A little unicorn?</i>

17:07.320 --> 17:08.320
<i>It seems</i>

17:08.500 --> 17:10.540
<i>to be trying to draw the
tyrannosaurus away for me.</i>

17:58.720 --> 17:59.840
<i>Ruo Shui.</i>

18:09.060 --> 18:10.999
Ruo Shui

18:11.000 --> 18:12.000
It's tied up now.

18:12.230 --> 18:13.520
Make sure to keep it safe.

18:14.540 --> 18:16.100
It's rare to celebrate a birthday once.

18:16.250 --> 18:17.450
Is this the only gift?

18:20.500 --> 18:22.320
Zulong Village

18:20.560 --> 18:21.759
This is a peace bracelet I got

18:21.760 --> 18:24.050
from an old monk with great effort.

18:22.321 --> 18:24.140
Ruo Shui's Dwelling

18:24.850 --> 18:26.570
If you don't want it, just return it to me.

18:27.020 --> 18:28.096
If you don't want it, return it to me.

18:28.120 --> 18:29.120
I won't give it back.

18:29.440 --> 18:31.000
Once you give it to me, it's mine.

18:29.820 --> 18:30.999
Zulong Village

18:31.000 --> 18:32.880
Return it to me.

18:31.001 --> 18:32.780
Back Mountain Cliff

18:39.920 --> 18:40.920
It is so beautiful.

18:45.480 --> 18:46.590
Brother Xiao,

18:47.440 --> 18:50.119
there used to be many
powerful cultivators in Jiuzhou.

18:50.120 --> 18:51.680
They all went to the World of Immortals

18:51.880 --> 18:52.960
and attained eternal life.

18:54.060 --> 18:56.680
Will you go as well?

18:58.240 --> 18:59.440
Eternal life might sound good,

19:00.120 --> 19:01.680
but it means nothing

19:02.500 --> 19:03.500
if

19:04.160 --> 19:05.450
You are all alone.

20:05.100 --> 20:09.060
Sea of Consciousness Space

20:12.280 --> 20:13.280
<i>In my youth,</i>

20:13.720 --> 20:16.800
<i>I discovered the Heavenly Stele
Method beneath the dried-up Yellow River.</i>

20:17.920 --> 20:21.120
<i>Due to depleted spiritual energy
in Jiuzhou, I made little progress.</i>

20:23.680 --> 20:24.680
<i>I never expected that</i>

20:24.910 --> 20:26.040
<i>today, with this dragon egg,</i>

20:26.100 --> 20:27.900
<i>I would finally break
through my limitations.</i>

20:28.110 --> 20:30.090
<i>Awakening the Heavenly Stele Method.</i>

20:28.460 --> 20:29.820
Heavenly Stele Profound Method

20:30.840 --> 20:31.840
<i>Moreover,</i>

20:32.070 --> 20:34.180
<i>the essence of the dragon
egg healed my injuries</i>

20:34.181 --> 20:35.479
Mortal Shedding First Level

20:35.480 --> 20:37.480
<i>and allowed me to enter
the Mortal Shedding realm,</i>

20:38.200 --> 20:40.000
<i>enabling me to connect
with elemental forces.</i>

20:40.110 --> 20:41.870
Gathering the essence
to form the technique.

21:14.540 --> 21:17.070
Beach of the Forbidden Sea

21:17.071 --> 21:19.600
Young Master, we are at Dragon Island.

21:24.280 --> 21:26.480
The century-long seal on
Dragon Island has been lifted.

21:27.400 --> 21:28.920
With your strength,

21:29.120 --> 21:31.760
you are sure to gain a lot from this trip.

21:35.550 --> 21:37.480
I have received news, Young Master.

21:37.990 --> 21:40.560
Several factions have already
landed on the island ahead of us.

21:40.180 --> 21:41.540
Gu Family Guardian

21:40.561 --> 21:42.900
Gu Yan

21:41.120 --> 21:42.199
Other guardians who sealed their powers

21:41.541 --> 21:42.900
Insight Treasury First Level

21:42.200 --> 21:44.840
are said to have entered the island.

21:45.980 --> 21:47.220
Please be careful

21:47.230 --> 21:48.540
when you set foot on the island.

21:48.780 --> 21:51.140
- Gu Luo
- Mortal Shedding Third Level

21:48.780 --> 21:51.140
Young Master of the Gu Family

21:48.880 --> 21:51.119
Do not worry.

21:51.120 --> 21:52.880
I have made ample preparations this time.

21:53.440 --> 21:55.920
I will definitely manage to bring
back some Dragon King eggs.

21:56.590 --> 22:00.189
I heard that consuming those
will greatly enhance one's strength.

22:00.190 --> 22:01.410
Young Master!

22:09.830 --> 22:10.960
A boat is approaching.

22:11.760 --> 22:13.760
I wonder if I can borrow
it to leave this island.

22:29.000 --> 22:31.490
The heavenly horse, with its
large wings and striking dark eyes,

22:31.500 --> 22:34.090
has a body resembling exquisite
white jade, making it a rare sacred beast.

22:34.110 --> 22:37.150
It symbolises purity and grace, only
approachable by a maiden of pure heart.

22:37.440 --> 22:45.440
Explore Immortality with "Shrouding
the Heavens" and "World of Immortals"

22:38.960 --> 22:39.960
The concept

22:40.680 --> 22:42.520
of eternal life poses profound questions.

22:45.640 --> 22:47.000
Where does life begin

22:48.840 --> 22:50.160
and where does it end?

22:52.600 --> 22:53.910
All living beings

22:54.360 --> 22:56.280
cannot escape the cycle of fate,

22:57.840 --> 22:59.880
ultimately transforming into mere dust.

23:01.280 --> 23:02.280
Perhaps

23:02.520 --> 23:03.560
one must

23:04.200 --> 23:05.960
seek their own answers to these mysteries.

23:11.910 --> 23:13.110
The immortal sages persist,

23:13.980 --> 23:15.740
while great thieves
continue their exploits.

23:16.710 --> 23:18.390
Many remarkable talents throughout history

23:18.830 --> 23:20.350
have faded into obscurity simply

23:21.250 --> 23:23.820
because they never attained eternal life.

23:26.740 --> 23:29.000
Now, as the heavens and earth stand still,

23:29.160 --> 23:30.750
only by shattering illusions

23:30.840 --> 23:32.080
and ending chaos

23:32.850 --> 23:36.040
can true eternity be reborn.

23:36.540 --> 23:38.700
World of Immortals

23:38.701 --> 23:39.780
 Dragon Island Arc

24:25.690 --> 24:32.690
A heart untouched by
dust, letting the past remain

24:33.290 --> 24:38.890
Old wounds hidden away by the years

24:39.890 --> 24:43.890
Turning through forgetfulness

24:44.210 --> 24:47.250
Fate is long-lasting

24:47.450 --> 24:52.810
Yet I still faintly remember your image

24:53.930 --> 24:56.809
Your gentle smile like the breeze

24:56.810 --> 25:00.730
A light shadow flowing
like water, with no echo

25:01.130 --> 25:03.849
Grant me a lifetime of wind and snow

25:03.850 --> 25:07.770
Together, we'll admire the
moonlight until the end of time

25:08.210 --> 25:12.370
A glance back feels like the first meeting

25:12.530 --> 25:15.490
The touch still warm to the skin

25:16.090 --> 25:17.889
The departed return to seek

25:17.890 --> 25:21.690
No regrets for the love once shared

25:22.130 --> 25:24.929
If only tender feelings could last forever

25:24.930 --> 25:28.970
Nourishing beauty as I look back once more

25:29.250 --> 25:32.049
I wish for the sea to remain untroubled

25:32.050 --> 25:36.010
The heart stays the same,
do not ponder too much

25:36.330 --> 25:40.729
That year by the jade zither,
listening to the flowers fall

25:40.730 --> 25:44.010
Ripples at the centre of tears

25:44.290 --> 25:46.209
This love can wait

25:46.210 --> 25:50.130
To see that yellowing scene again

25:51.330 --> 25:53.249
Through the long years

25:53.250 --> 25:57.930
Together with you in vastness

25:58.410 --> 26:01.409
Asking the world

26:01.410 --> 26:05.250
How can love be complete?

26:05.570 --> 26:08.689
Remembering the past years

26:08.690 --> 26:12.130
Always feeling indebted

26:12.570 --> 26:15.250
When will we

26:15.570 --> 26:19.410
Meet again?

26:19.610 --> 26:22.330
Once stood side by side

26:22.770 --> 26:26.610
Talking for ages

26:56.500 --> 26:59.119
Next Episode

26:59.120 --> 27:00.479
There are monsters!

27:00.480 --> 27:02.600
Young Master!

27:03.190 --> 27:04.910
<i>First, I will use this place to recuperate.</i>

27:04.950 --> 27:07.670
<i>Once my injuries are healed, I
will seek a way to return to Jiuzhou.</i>

27:07.780 --> 27:09.099
You killed my maid

27:09.100 --> 27:10.640
and caused my downfall.

27:10.820 --> 27:12.730
You must die.

27:19.360 --> 27:21.480
Even if I find myself
in a perilous situation,

27:21.820 --> 27:24.540
I will navigate this World of
Immortals with determination

27:24.860 --> 27:26.156
and view danger as mere obstacles.

27:26.180 --> 27:27.356
World of Immortals

27:27.380 --> 27:29.800
Dragon Island Arc
